  "about_item": [
    "Tempered Glass Surface: The 41.5 in wide tempered glass top gives you a smooth, wipe-clean workspace for drafting, drawing, painting, and crafts, with filleted edges and rounded corners",
    "Tilts From 0 To 65 Degrees: Work flat for writing or laptop tasks, then raise the desktop up to 65 degrees for sketching and drafting, using the pencil ledge to hold paper and tools in place",
    "Storage Within Reach: Four removable stationery trays with honeycomb pen holes sit on both sides of the desktop, and two silent-glide fabric drawers on the right hold larger tools and supplies",
    "Move It Or Plant It: Four 360 degree swivel casters roll the desk between rooms and two lock to hold position, or swap to the four included rubber feet for a stationary setup on wood floors",
    "Built For Makers: Sized for diamond painting, tracing comic pages over a light pad, sketching, architectural drafting, and everyday desk work in a home studio, classroom, or office"
  ],
